{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><br><strong>Obsidian Core Technologies: Freelance Miner\u2019s Guide</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome, Freelancer, to Obsidian Core Technologies! As our newest hire, you\u2019ve been dispatched to the mineral-rich planet of Planet-14416331, a volatile world brimming with natural resources. Your mission is to extract rare ores, amass a fortune, and receive some of that fortune for yourself! Dig deep (into <i>your</i>\u00a0pockets)<i>\u00a0</i>and upgrade your gear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DIG</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The most valuable ores are deep down.  <br>Dig as deep as you can and extract the most valuable ores. Take them to the refinery and we will compensate you 0.035671% of the value of those ores. It is our mission to maintain fair pay for fair work. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UPGRADE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you have brought your own drill rig, we have provided an outpost to facilitate use of your commission to further upgrade. Allowing you to reach deeper into the crust and extract ores that will be far more profitable to the company. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SURVIVE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At Obsidian Core Technologies, we prioritize your success in extracting the planet\u2019s resources. Planet-14416331 has been meticulously surveyed to ensure optimal mining conditions. However, just in case minor inconveniences arise we\u2019ve thoughtfully outfitted an Arms Dealer at your personal outpost. They offer a selection of tools and enhancements to safeguard your operations, ensuring you can focus on delivering valuable ores to our refineries.<strong><u> </u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"All your base are belong to us.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/a